sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Merchandiser / Store Admin
  participant API as Mining API
  participant Service as Mining service
  participant Snapshot as Snapshot repository
  participant Worker as Mining worker
  participant Engine as HUI-Miner / EFIM runtime
  participant DB as Database
  User->>API: Create request(snapshot, algorithms, threshold, request key)
  API->>Service: Validate role, store, snapshot and payload
  Service->>Snapshot: Load READY snapshot and frozen matrix
  Snapshot-->>Service: Frozen rows and hashes
  Service->>Service: Build normalized immutable input
  Service->>DB: Persist PENDING request and run rows
  Service->>Worker: Enqueue request
  API-->>User: Request ID / PENDING
  Worker->>DB: Claim request and run as RUNNING
  loop selected algorithms
    Worker->>Engine: Execute on frozen input and threshold
    Engine-->>Worker: Patterns, metrics or execution error
    Worker->>DB: Persist patterns and terminal run status
  end
  Worker->>DB: Finalize request status
  User->>API: Read request, runs and patterns
  API->>DB: Query store-scoped persisted results
  DB-->>API: Status and evidence
  API-->>User: Mining results
